---
const pillars = [
  {
    title: "Karst peaks",
    chinese: "喀斯特",
    body: "Guilin and Yangshuo's limestone towers, the classic Chinese landscape drawn in emerald and stone, best seen from the Li River.",
    img: "/images/guilin.webp",
    alt: "Karst peaks rising from the Li River",
    span: "lg:col-span-7",
  },
  {
    title: "Coast & volcanic island",
    chinese: "海岸火山",
    body: "Beihai's Silver Beach and Weizhou, China's youngest volcanic island, with black basalt cliffs and coral reefs.",
    img: "/images/beihai-weizhou.webp",
    alt: "Coastline near Beihai, Guangxi",
    span: "lg:col-span-5",
  },
  {
    title: "Rice terraces",
    chinese: "梯田",
    body: "The Longji terraces, carved by the Zhuang and Yao over 650 years, mirror the sky when flooded each spring.",
    img: "/images/longji.webp",
    alt: "Flooded rice terraces at Longji",
    span: "lg:col-span-5",
  },
  {
    title: "Tiankeng & underground rivers",
    chinese: "天坑",
    body: "Hechi's raw karst: sinkholes, blue underground lakes and caves that few foreign travelers ever reach.",
    img: "/images/bama.webp",
    alt: "Sinkhole lakes and karst near Bama, Hechi",
    span: "lg:col-span-7",
  },
];
---
<section id="why" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 pb-1">
        Four landscapes, one province
      </h2>
      <p class="text-stone-500 text-lg mt-4 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Guangxi is China's only region that is coastal, border-facing and karst-covered at once. Break it into four landforms and a trip here never feels repetitive.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5">
      {pillars.map((p) => (
        <a href="#destinations" class={`group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl min-h-[280px] ${p.span}`}>
          <img src={p.img} alt={p.alt} class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-brand-950/90 via-brand-950/30 to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="relative z-10 p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-end h-full">
            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white">{p.title} <span class="text-white/60 text-base font-medium">{p.chinese}</span></h3>
            <p class="text-white/80 text-sm mt-2 max-w-md leading-relaxed">{p.body}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
